                "type": "text",
                "content": "Rounding gives a number that is close enough but much easier to use. Rounding to the nearest thousand smooths a number to the nearest 1,000. Quick words: digit means a single number symbol like 0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, or 9. hundreds digit means the third number from the right in a whole number.",
